Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"dba","pool":"pool3","dba_max_iter":30}

Thought: Test the single best model candidate other than catboost to see if another model outperforms the robust median.  
Action: evaluate_strategy  
Action Input: {"combine":"best_single","model":"ONLY_CWT_catboost"}

Thought: Test a weighted combination using inverse‑error weighting on the most stable pool3 to see if it improves over the robust median.  
